                <mxCell id="20" value="&lt;div&gt;- Siloed systems&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Inconsistent standards&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Limited data literacy prevent information from flowing across agencies&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;labelBackgroundColor=default;fontSize=12;fontColor=#FFFFFF;horizontal=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
